    rdf:value """Wednesday, Nov. 4, 1908
Somerset Hotel, Boston.
Lunched at the Hales. Old Edward Everett was in splendid form, full of interest in everything. Grand old figure.
Dined at Dorchester. """^^xsd:string ;
